WEBVTT

00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:05.000
This show contains scenes that some viewers may 
find disturbing.​ Viewer discretion ​is ​advised.

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:03.730
<i>What's going on with this armor?</i>

00:00:04.730 --> 00:00:08.820
<i>The moment I put it on, 
all the pain went away.</i>

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:10.900
<i>Rather,</i>

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:15.350
<i>I don't care about pain anymore.</i>

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:17.970
<i>What's more important than pain</i>

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:22.120
<i>is this impulse that's rising within me.</i>

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:27.000
<i>I feel something violent, 
boiling up from within.</i>

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:29.170
Let go...

00:00:29.170 --> 00:00:30.050
<i>I see.</i>

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:30.840
<i>This...</i>

00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:34.550
Let go of everything.

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:36.050
<i>This is my...</i>

00:00:36.050 --> 00:00:38.050
Let go.

00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:41.350
Let go of everything.

00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:43.600
Let go!

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:47.650
The armor's changing!

00:00:55.030 --> 00:00:58.530
<b><i>A Journey Begins in Flames</i></b>

00:02:26.120 --> 00:02:27.620
Interesting...

00:02:27.620 --> 00:02:30.210
So that is your true power!

00:02:30.210 --> 00:02:33.710
That's what makes you 
worth destroying!

00:02:40.720 --> 00:02:43.100
<i>He knocked my huge body away?</i>

00:02:47.850 --> 00:02:50.350
<i>What strength!</i>

00:02:50.350 --> 00:02:53.690
<i>Is this strike coming from the 
same person as before?</i>

00:02:58.070 --> 00:03:02.110
My shield can deflect a cannonball, 
and he shattered it?

00:03:03.030 --> 00:03:06.620
<i>No man in such heavy armor, 
with that huge sword...</i>

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:09.000
<i>No, no human</i>

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:11.750
<i>can move like that!</i>

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:22.260
<i>He has a cannon in his false hand?</i>

00:03:22.680 --> 00:03:25.470
He's always as strong as a monster,

00:03:25.470 --> 00:03:28.520
but today, he seems even 
stronger than usual.

00:03:28.520 --> 00:03:31.060
That false hand was a cannon?

00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:32.770
Scary...

00:03:32.770 --> 00:03:36.320
This will be dangerous if he 
continues to fight like that.

00:03:37.110 --> 00:03:39.030
What are you talking about?

00:03:39.030 --> 00:03:42.660
Guts's wounds haven't healed.

00:03:42.660 --> 00:03:45.160
He simply cannot feel the pain.

00:03:45.160 --> 00:03:46.620
The pain?

00:03:47.370 --> 00:03:50.790
That relic was forged by dwarfs,

00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:53.170
the Berserker Armor.

00:03:53.170 --> 00:03:54.750
The Berserker...

00:03:54.750 --> 00:03:56.250
...Armor...

00:03:56.590 --> 00:03:58.380
He who wears that armor

00:03:58.380 --> 00:04:02.170
and synchronizes himself with 
the terrible flow of od within

00:04:02.170 --> 00:04:04.430
becomes unstoppable.

00:04:04.430 --> 00:04:09.180
The passions within him are so strong,
 he ceases to feel pain or fear.

00:04:09.810 --> 00:04:12.890
Humans unconsciously limit

00:04:12.890 --> 00:04:16.270
their own strength to 
protect themselves.

00:04:16.270 --> 00:04:20.400
Pain is a warning to keep the 
body from destroying itself.

00:04:20.990 --> 00:04:26.030
Without pain, humans become 
incredibly strong and agile.

00:04:26.030 --> 00:04:30.040
They surpass the body's limits, 
endangering their lives.

00:04:37.330 --> 00:04:40.050
What's happening to Guts?

00:04:40.380 --> 00:04:41.340
<i>No...</i>

00:04:41.340 --> 00:04:43.510
<i>I'm not strong enough to overcome that</i>

00:04:43.510 --> 00:04:46.050
<i>powerful flow of od and 
communicate with him.</i>

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:48.550
Impressive, Black Swordsman,

00:04:48.550 --> 00:04:50.680
our enemy.

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:56.310
Then take my strongest blow!

00:04:58.060 --> 00:04:59.320
What?

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:08.870
He won!

00:05:08.870 --> 00:05:10.450
<i>But...</i>

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:16.290
Splendid.

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:20.040
You have won our duel.

00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:22.050
The rumors were true.

00:05:22.050 --> 00:05:25.220
No, you are magnificent, 
even stronger than rumored!

00:05:26.090 --> 00:05:27.260
However,

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:30.470
this is my great task.

00:05:30.470 --> 00:05:32.770
For my master...

00:05:32.770 --> 00:05:35.310
As an Apostle of the Hawk of Light,

00:05:35.310 --> 00:05:37.270
I will end you!

00:05:43.770 --> 00:05:45.490
A dragon?!

00:05:45.490 --> 00:05:49.820
With the power granted 
to me as an Apostle,

00:05:49.820 --> 00:05:52.660
I will bury the Black Swordsman!

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:56.250
He blocked it?

00:05:56.250 --> 00:05:57.500
Oh, shit...

00:05:57.500 --> 00:05:59.500
I-Impossible.

00:05:59.500 --> 00:06:00.500
He stopped it?

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:04.630
A human stopped an Apostle's attack?

00:06:05.590 --> 00:06:07.470
I refuse to accept it!

00:06:15.220 --> 00:06:17.890
My corundum skin is harder than steel,

00:06:17.890 --> 00:06:21.020
and you cracked it?

00:06:21.860 --> 00:06:23.480
That isn't possible...

00:06:32.780 --> 00:06:37.040
Hey, weren't his limbs pointing 
in directions they shouldn't?

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:39.040
It's the power of the armor.

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:43.130
The armor is supporting 
his broken limbs.

00:06:43.130 --> 00:06:45.800
It's pierced his flesh, 
digging into his bones.

00:06:45.800 --> 00:06:51.390
The last bearer of that armor let 
its steel teeth dig into his body.

00:06:51.390 --> 00:06:53.100
He fought until he died,

00:06:53.100 --> 00:06:57.930
his bones all broken, and his blood 
all drained from his body.

00:06:59.390 --> 00:07:03.230
Why use such a dangerous thing on 
Guts if he's almost dead already?

00:07:03.230 --> 00:07:07.440
I-It's a noble sacrifice to 
save his companions!

00:07:08.320 --> 00:07:09.700
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:07:09.700 --> 00:07:12.240
<i>It's my fault, once again...</i>

00:07:13.030 --> 00:07:15.200
<i>Mistress, why?</i>

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:16.870
<i>Why that?</i>

00:07:17.450 --> 00:07:19.710
<i>What do I do?</i>

00:07:19.710 --> 00:07:22.170
<i>You must handle it.</i>

00:07:22.170 --> 00:07:26.170
<i>Only you, a witch, can do it.</i>

00:07:26.170 --> 00:07:27.630
Mistress!

00:07:28.420 --> 00:07:31.180
But I am so inexperienced.

00:07:31.180 --> 00:07:33.550
My heart's in such chaos, 
I cannot use magic.

00:07:34.090 --> 00:07:36.140
<i>Only now that you know</i>

00:07:36.140 --> 00:07:40.350
<i>your inexperience and how easy 
it is to drown in your power,</i>

00:07:40.350 --> 00:07:41.980
<i>can you do it.</i>

00:07:42.390 --> 00:07:45.810
<i>You must show the path to 
the swordsman inside</i>

00:07:45.810 --> 00:07:48.650
<i>those swirling currents of power.</i>

00:07:49.570 --> 00:07:51.610
H-Hey, what are you gonna do?

00:07:51.610 --> 00:07:53.740
Bring Guts back.

00:07:53.740 --> 00:07:56.870
Take care of my body.

00:07:56.870 --> 00:07:58.700
<i>I'll do it, Mistress.</i>

00:07:58.490 --> 00:07:59.620
Take care of it?

00:07:59.620 --> 00:08:00.620
Hey!

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:03.330
<i>I will save him.</i>

00:08:04.540 --> 00:08:06.630
I can't believe it.

00:08:06.630 --> 00:08:10.670
You've endured two of my 
attacks in this form.

00:08:10.670 --> 00:08:13.430
And even injured me?

00:08:13.430 --> 00:08:15.390
What are you?

00:08:15.390 --> 00:08:17.390
Fire Dragon, sir...

00:08:17.390 --> 00:08:19.930
Let us join in, too!

00:08:19.930 --> 00:08:23.020
We didn't get to kill the witch,

00:08:23.020 --> 00:08:25.850
and now we don't have anything to do.

00:08:25.850 --> 00:08:27.900
Looks like you're having a hard time...

00:08:27.900 --> 00:08:29.650
You...

00:08:29.650 --> 00:08:31.030
Come on...

00:08:31.030 --> 00:08:34.110
If it's a fight as an Apostle, 
not a duel, isn't it all—

00:08:36.410 --> 00:08:39.620
No fair! He was in the 
middle of transforming!

00:08:42.160 --> 00:08:43.910
You bastard!

00:08:44.580 --> 00:08:45.790
This feeling...

00:08:45.790 --> 00:08:47.790
I broke four or five ribs, huh?

00:08:56.090 --> 00:08:59.970
His fighting style's getting 
less and less human.

00:09:00.350 --> 00:09:01.560
<i>Human...</i>

00:09:02.180 --> 00:09:04.810
<i>No, it's almost as if...</i>

00:09:07.310 --> 00:09:10.320
I see something yummy over here.

00:09:12.320 --> 00:09:15.740
If we must, we take Schierke and run!

00:09:15.740 --> 00:09:16.740
Right!

00:09:16.740 --> 00:09:18.570
Schierke...

00:09:18.570 --> 00:09:20.030
These...

00:09:24.620 --> 00:09:28.830
These are the currents of 
hatred within the armor.

00:09:29.290 --> 00:09:30.790
Will I make it in time?

00:09:30.790 --> 00:09:32.840
Any normal person

00:09:32.840 --> 00:09:35.800
swallowed by this would have 
their ego torn apart.

00:09:37.550 --> 00:09:38.550
This is...

00:09:44.480 --> 00:09:49.440
Guts's hatred, given form 
by the armor's od?

00:09:50.020 --> 00:09:51.980
Guts is inside?

00:09:55.150 --> 00:09:57.400
Can I do this?

00:09:57.400 --> 00:10:01.490
Can I save him from these 
terrible currents?

00:10:01.950 --> 00:10:04.870
One mistake, and I'll be dragged along.

00:10:09.920 --> 00:10:11.790
This isn't the time to hesitate!

00:10:19.390 --> 00:10:21.260
<i>Bubbles of light?</i>

00:10:22.970 --> 00:10:25.600
<i>Fragments of Guts's memories?</i>

00:10:30.400 --> 00:10:32.650
<i>They are like torchlights...</i>

00:10:34.480 --> 00:10:35.780
<i>The darkness is heaving?</i>

00:10:42.280 --> 00:10:43.330
No!

00:10:43.330 --> 00:10:45.160
What? I'm scared.

00:10:45.160 --> 00:10:46.580
It's sucking me in...

00:10:47.120 --> 00:10:49.080
Mistress!

00:10:58.300 --> 00:10:59.590
<i>That is...</i>

00:11:00.550 --> 00:11:02.300
<i>my mistress's...</i>

00:11:14.900 --> 00:11:16.150
I see.

00:11:16.150 --> 00:11:18.320
This is Guts's ego.

00:11:18.860 --> 00:11:23.030
The talisman my mistress 
made held it together.

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:28.330
No! Don't let the flow take you!

00:11:28.660 --> 00:11:31.120
Take... me?

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:35.130
Yes, you will cease to be yourself.

00:11:35.130 --> 00:11:37.590
This place will absorb you!

00:11:38.340 --> 00:11:40.510
Remember who you are!

00:11:41.090 --> 00:11:43.430
It doesn't... matter.

00:11:43.930 --> 00:11:45.640
Kill. Destroy. Ruin.

00:11:46.680 --> 00:11:48.350
Slash. Fight. Enemy.

00:11:49.140 --> 00:11:51.020
Apostle. Enemy. Friend.

00:11:51.600 --> 00:11:52.690
Griffith...

00:11:53.230 --> 00:11:54.610
<i>It's so hot.</i>

00:11:55.400 --> 00:11:57.400
It does matter!

00:11:57.400 --> 00:12:00.690
Remember the reason you travel.

00:12:00.690 --> 00:12:02.740
The reason you're fighting right now!

00:12:03.780 --> 00:12:05.820
A human soul wouldn't let itself

00:12:05.820 --> 00:12:09.500
be so badly hurt for something 
that doesn't matter!

00:12:09.870 --> 00:12:10.870
Travel...

00:12:10.870 --> 00:12:12.290
Fight...

00:12:12.290 --> 00:12:13.500
Reason.

00:12:21.090 --> 00:12:22.880
What is... this?

00:12:27.510 --> 00:12:30.060
Who is this?

00:12:35.980 --> 00:12:37.310
I know her.

00:12:39.440 --> 00:12:42.150
Stop... Don't touch her.

00:12:43.150 --> 00:12:46.660
Remember her! Her name is Casca!

00:12:46.950 --> 00:12:49.200
Casca...

00:12:50.290 --> 00:12:52.910
Your name is Guts!

00:12:53.330 --> 00:12:55.710
The branded swordsman, Guts!

00:12:57.000 --> 00:13:00.250
Protector of the branded woman, Casca!

00:13:04.510 --> 00:13:07.890
Taste my burning heat!

00:13:12.350 --> 00:13:13.560
What?

00:13:20.610 --> 00:13:22.440
Inhuman!

00:13:21.360 --> 00:13:22.440
Guts!

00:13:22.440 --> 00:13:24.110
No, Casca!

00:13:37.670 --> 00:13:39.130
Who are you?

00:13:48.220 --> 00:13:49.890
Guts...

00:13:49.890 --> 00:13:51.470
How awful.

00:14:00.310 --> 00:14:02.480
I won't let you get away!

00:14:03.280 --> 00:14:04.860
It's all right.

00:14:08.950 --> 00:14:10.240
That's...

00:14:15.700 --> 00:14:17.250
Mistress!

00:14:23.840 --> 00:14:24.880
She's huge.

00:14:24.880 --> 00:14:26.260
And young.

00:14:26.840 --> 00:14:30.260
You did well, Schierke.

00:14:30.890 --> 00:14:32.550
Go.

00:14:32.550 --> 00:14:35.560
This forest will not last long.

00:14:35.560 --> 00:14:37.850
When the spirit tree falls,

00:14:37.850 --> 00:14:40.270
this domain will close.

00:14:41.270 --> 00:14:44.650
No... No, I don't...

00:14:45.780 --> 00:14:50.110
This is an interstice, where time 
drifts and flickers for old things.

00:14:50.110 --> 00:14:54.450
Both this tree and I have 
lived a little too long.

00:14:54.450 --> 00:14:57.200
No matter how enjoyable the sunlight,

00:14:57.200 --> 00:15:01.790
young things must not stay here forever.

00:15:02.670 --> 00:15:05.550
It's time to leave the nest.

00:15:05.550 --> 00:15:11.090
Leave this place and find
your own path, my disciple

00:15:11.800 --> 00:15:15.260
I did not stay with you for many days.

00:15:15.260 --> 00:15:20.980
But in my long life, 
they were the most peaceful.

00:15:21.560 --> 00:15:22.980
Thank you.

00:15:22.980 --> 00:15:25.070
Mistress!

00:15:25.320 --> 00:15:26.860
Hey, you idiot!

00:15:28.940 --> 00:15:30.400
Let's go.

00:15:30.400 --> 00:15:32.950
Wait... Black Swordsman!

00:15:33.700 --> 00:15:36.370
What is this flame?

00:15:36.990 --> 00:15:40.000
That even I, a fire dragon, 
cannot dispel?

00:15:40.410 --> 00:15:43.960
<i>Life simply changes form.</i>

00:15:43.960 --> 00:15:47.090
<i>We will see each other 
again in your dreams.</i>

00:15:47.920 --> 00:15:52.300
<i>It's up to you whether you grab 
the fate in front of you.</i>

00:15:52.890 --> 00:15:58.100
<i>Blessings upon your new 
journey, beloved child.</i>

00:15:59.890 --> 00:16:03.560
<i>Farewell, my sunlight.</i>

00:16:24.710 --> 00:16:25.630
That's it.

00:16:34.050 --> 00:16:36.390
Are you with the resistance?

00:16:36.390 --> 00:16:37.760
Indeed.

00:16:37.760 --> 00:16:40.220
A pleasure to meet you.

00:16:40.220 --> 00:16:45.270
I am Laban, of Midland's Arklaw Knights.

00:16:46.150 --> 00:16:47.650
Sir Laban,

00:16:47.650 --> 00:16:51.780
you came to see us yourself?

00:16:51.780 --> 00:16:54.820
As a military man, I admire

00:16:54.820 --> 00:16:57.780
what you have accomplished so far.

00:16:59.160 --> 00:17:04.160
No, "the resistance" is only a name.

00:17:04.160 --> 00:17:09.090
All we can do is crawl beneath 
the earth, like moles.

00:17:10.170 --> 00:17:12.300
Windham has become

00:17:12.300 --> 00:17:16.220
a city of demons, as if it were 
not a part of this world.

00:17:16.760 --> 00:17:19.140
All who resisted were killed.

00:17:19.140 --> 00:17:22.600
And all who were arrested, 
regardless of class,

00:17:22.600 --> 00:17:25.640
were sent to the battlefield 
as war slaves.

00:17:26.060 --> 00:17:28.400
The women were sent to the castle,

00:17:28.400 --> 00:17:32.820
where they are evidently being 
used in strange Kushan rituals.

00:17:32.820 --> 00:17:34.860
We know not if they live.

00:17:34.860 --> 00:17:39.030
The only ones left are helpless 
children and elderly.

00:17:40.030 --> 00:17:42.240
How terrible...

00:17:42.700 --> 00:17:45.660
But there is one piece of good news.

00:17:46.750 --> 00:17:49.460
Princess Charlotte is alive.

00:17:49.460 --> 00:17:52.130
We are told she is locked up,

00:17:52.130 --> 00:17:54.550
on the Tower of Rebirth's highest floor.

00:17:55.510 --> 00:17:57.380
Is that true?

00:17:57.380 --> 00:17:58.890
It is certain.

00:17:58.890 --> 00:18:03.310
We lost many comrades to 
obtain this information.

00:18:03.310 --> 00:18:05.680
If the princess is safe...

00:18:05.680 --> 00:18:09.900
If the royal bloodline flows, 
there is still hope!

00:18:09.900 --> 00:18:14.280
Sir Laban, we are isolated 
here, in the capital,

00:18:14.280 --> 00:18:18.160
knowing very little of what is 
happening on the outside.

00:18:18.160 --> 00:18:21.580
So I wished to ask about 
a certain rumor.

00:18:22.740 --> 00:18:25.290
Where is the hawk?

00:18:27.120 --> 00:18:28.000
What?

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:30.170
No... It's them.

00:18:34.670 --> 00:18:36.380
Th-This is...

00:18:36.800 --> 00:18:38.430
Sir Laban, this way!

00:18:41.930 --> 00:18:43.930
What is that monster?

00:18:43.930 --> 00:18:46.180
Kushan magic.

00:18:46.180 --> 00:18:52.860
The Kushans use magic to command 
half-man, half-beast creatures!

00:18:57.700 --> 00:18:59.740
It's impossible to believe,

00:18:59.740 --> 00:19:02.950
even though I just saw it 
with my own eyes.

00:19:02.950 --> 00:19:05.040
We feel the same.

00:19:05.540 --> 00:19:08.730
At some point, fog covered the city.

00:19:08.730 --> 00:19:15.550
And the monsters came, as if drawn by it.

00:19:15.550 --> 00:19:17.670
The citizens fear them,

00:19:17.670 --> 00:19:20.550
and hide themselves in their homes.

00:19:34.060 --> 00:19:35.770
W-We're trapped!

00:19:43.320 --> 00:19:45.660
Arrows? From where?

00:19:50.250 --> 00:19:51.290
That's...

00:20:03.890 --> 00:20:05.850
People of Windham,

00:20:05.850 --> 00:20:08.100
for now, hide and wait.

00:20:08.720 --> 00:20:13.910
A strong wind will come to blow 
away the miasma over the city.

00:20:14.690 --> 00:20:17.480
Who are you?

00:20:17.940 --> 00:20:21.820
I am on a mission now, and I must go.

00:20:21.820 --> 00:20:23.780
Hide and prepare,

00:20:23.780 --> 00:20:26.740
for the storm the hawk will bring.

00:22:06.910 --> 00:22:09.020
So huge!

00:22:11.390 --> 00:22:12.930
He appears to be having fun.

00:22:12.930 --> 00:22:14.450
You're such a kid.

00:22:14.450 --> 00:22:16.840
This is just a puddle.

00:22:16.840 --> 00:22:18.510
Right, Schierke?

00:22:31.380 --> 00:22:32.410
Thanks.

00:22:40.480 --> 00:22:41.470
Guts...

00:22:42.450 --> 00:22:45.220
Um, are you all right?

00:22:47.730 --> 00:22:50.890
My body isn't that fragile.

00:22:50.890 --> 00:22:52.090
Don't worry.

00:22:53.850 --> 00:22:57.370
But I still think you should 
remove that armor

00:22:57.370 --> 00:23:00.600
and rest at least four or five days.

00:23:00.600 --> 00:23:03.550
I've been recovering for almost a month.

00:23:03.550 --> 00:23:05.610
We have no more time to waste.

00:23:06.760 --> 00:23:09.580
The pain doesn't lessen as 
much as when I'm fighting.

00:23:09.580 --> 00:23:12.630
But even so, I can travel 
just fine, thanks to this.

00:23:12.630 --> 00:23:14.290
You shouldn't lower your guard.

00:23:14.290 --> 00:23:15.790
That armor is cursed.

00:23:15.790 --> 00:23:18.580
If you get into a fight, 
you might lose control again.

00:23:18.580 --> 00:23:22.120
If that happens, I have a 
witch I can rely on, right?

00:23:25.540 --> 00:23:27.610
<i>You really are reckless.</i>

00:23:28.620 --> 00:23:30.950
<i>If that happens again...</i>

00:23:31.350 --> 00:23:34.730
<i>No, even now, there's no 
guarantee he'll survive.</i>

00:23:35.910 --> 00:23:37.320
This is nice.

00:23:43.540 --> 00:23:45.400
I thought I'd never see it again...

00:23:47.240 --> 00:23:51.660
See the sun set so peacefully.

00:23:57.040 --> 00:24:00.960
<b><i>Next Episode Preview</i></b>

00:24:02.710 --> 00:24:04.500
<b>...Elf Hell.</b>

00:24:07.000 --> 00:24:09.090
<b>Would you teach me magic?</b>

00:24:11.220 --> 00:24:13.390
<b>I've departed on a journey from 
which there is no return.</b>

00:24:15.470 --> 00:24:17.560
<b>Something's coming, 
hiding in the fog.</b>

00:24:19.600 --> 00:24:21.560
<b>It's the perfect chance to get my 
body back into fighting shape.</b>

00:24:23.980 --> 00:24:27.080
<b><i>Next Episode
 Proclaimed Omens</i></b>
